---
title: Document Knowledge - reading files into retrieval, writing them back
---
flowchart TB
    Share([A file shared in iMessage,<br/>the web, or the API]) --> Classify[Type proven by first bytes<br/>text stays here]
    Classify -->|PDF · Word · PowerPoint| Probe{Parser<br/>answering?}
    Probe -->|yes| Docling[Docling on the desktop GPU<br/>Markdown with page breaks]
    Probe -->|no| Queue[(Durable parse queue<br/>health-gated passes,<br/>no attempts burned while down)]
    Queue -. when the desktop returns .-> Docling
    Docling --> Ingest[Page-aware chunks · content hash<br/>same bytes reuse · new version supersedes]
    Ingest --> Store[(Knowledge store in pgvector<br/>the memory space, 768-d nomic<br/>owner-scoped, encrypted, backed up)]
    Ingest --> Facts[Digest to first-person statements<br/>memory classifier decides]
    Facts --> Memory[(Speaker's memory + the room's<br/>never another member's)]

    Ask([A question, or a reply<br/>to the document's bubble]) --> Search[Two probes, distance 0.5, top 6<br/>pinned document scopes the search]
    Search -. reads .-> Store
    Search --> Reply[Reply cites document and page<br/>abstains outside the passages]
    Ask -. "shared a document" line<br/>keeps the file the referent .-> Search

    Forget([Forget that document]) --> Undo[Undo ledger: newest<br/>document receipt] --> Store

    Want([Put that in a PDF]) --> Writer[create_document<br/>Word file built here]
    Writer -->|PDF asked, renderer up| Print[Gotenberg LibreOffice route<br/>on the desktop prints the Word file]
    Writer -->|renderer away| Docx[Word file, and the reply says so]
    Print --> Artifact[(Artifact store, kind document<br/>opaque key, hash, size)]
    Docx --> Artifact
    Artifact --> Out[Web card to save ·<br/>iMessage attachment under its title,<br/>bridge proves PDF/Word by first bytes]

    classDef person fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef step fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef store fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef desktop fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d08a2a,color:#4a2f00;
    class Share,Ask,Forget,Want person;
    class Classify,Probe,Ingest,Facts,Search,Reply,Undo,Writer,Docx,Out step;
    class Queue,Store,Memory,Artifact store;
    class Docling,Print desktop;
